:: RobinTemple Spear
<!-- ./src/twee/RobinTemple/Spear.twee -->
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $temple_spear_mission is 1 and !$spear_vessel and !$RobinTemple.spear_seen>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.spear_seen to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>Robin stops turning the page of <<his>> schoolbook. "Jordan told me about the spear," <<he>> says. "I know you can find it. I just wish I could go with you."
    <<option 'CN'>>罗宾停下翻书的手。“约旦把长矛的事告诉我了，”<<he>>说，“我知道你能找到它。只是希望我也能跟你去。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>><<He>> checks the map with you, marking the last place Jordan knew the vessel had been seen. "Come back and tell me what happened," <<he>> says.
    <<option 'CN'>><<He>>陪你看地图，标出约旦最后得知船只出现的地点。“回来以后，告诉我发生了什么。”<<he>>说。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '答应回来告诉罗宾' 'RobinTemple Spear Reassure'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '请罗宾帮你检查准备' 'RobinTemple Spear Prepare'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>Robin has already told you what <<he>> knows about the spear.
    <<option 'CN'>>罗宾已经把自己知道的长矛线索告诉你了。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Spear Reassure
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>"I will," you say. Robin folds the map carefully and hands it back. <<He>> stays with you until Jordan calls for the evening prayer.
  <<option 'CN'>>“我会的。”你说。罗宾仔细折好地图，交还给你。<<He>>一直陪着你，直到约旦召集晚祷。
<</language>>
<<npcincr Robin love 2>><<stress -2>><br><br><<glove>><<lstress>>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Spear Prepare
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>Robin asks how you mean to return if the route changes. You work through two possibilities together. <<He>> cannot make the journey safe, but <<he>> makes sure someone will know where to look.
  <<option 'CN'>>罗宾问你，如果路线有变打算怎样回来。你们一起想出两种办法。<<He>>无法替你排除路上的危险，却能确保有人知道去哪里找你。
<</language>>
<<willpower 1>><<npcincr Robin dom 1>><br><br><<gwillpower>><<gdom>>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Spear Return
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if !$RobinTemple.spear_return_seen>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.spear_return_seen to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>Robin sees you before you reach the bench. <<He>> closes the schoolbook and waits while you tell <<him>> where the journey took you.
    <<option 'CN'>>你还没走到长椅，罗宾就看见了你。<<He>>合上课本，等你讲述这一路去了哪里。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $spear_vessel is 'temple'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>"So it is back here," <<he>> says. <<He>> glances toward the altar, then back at you. "And you are back too."
      <<option 'CN'>>“长矛回到这里了，”<<he>>说。<<He>>看了一眼祭坛，又看向你。“你也回来了。”
    <</language>>
  <<elseif $spear_vessel is 'sea' or $spear_vessel is 'Zephyr'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>The spear has not reached the altar, but Robin listens to the decision you made. "Jordan should hear it from you," <<he>> says.
      <<option 'CN'>>长矛还没回到祭坛，但罗宾听完了你的决定。“该由你亲口告诉约旦，”<<he>>说。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>Robin asks what you learned. When you falter, <<he>> reminds you that the route home mattered as much as the thing you were sent to find.
      <<option 'CN'>>罗宾问你一路看到了什么。你一时说不下去，<<he>>提醒你，回来的路和你被派去寻找的东西一样重要。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 2>><<stress -3>><br><br><<glove>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>You have already told Robin about the journey.
    <<option 'CN'>>你已经把旅途的经过告诉罗宾了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>
